Small deterministic matched-range sample; use fixed work to assess throughput separately.
snb-pow --root HEX64 --threshold U64 [--mode gpu|cpu|hybrid] (default gpu)
  --kernel FILE       built 12-round predicated kernel (default SIMD16)
  --lanes 8|16        kernel width; must match the built blob
  --base U64          aligned first nonce (default 0)
  --threads 1..4096   GPU media packets per batch (default 4096)
  --cpu-workers 1..8  default: 1 in hybrid; min(3, online-1), at least 1 in cpu
  --max-hashes N      exact global work limit; 0 means unbounded
Exit 0: CPU-verified work; 3: no hit/exhausted; 5: GPU reset; 1/2: error.
A final partial GPU vector is searched on the CPU and counted separately.
